  "details": "During today's Community Meetup (9-25-2022), multiple users reported the \"PlayerName Has Joined\" notification becoming slow after multiple players joined quickly, stacking up and rarely properly clearing. This issue seemed to spread to the rest of the menu as well, with the quick menu not properly opening or closing due to it's animations being slowed down (sometimes never closing or opening fully at all), the main menu transitions getting stuck halfway through, and even the white \"flash\" on the camera not properly fading out until closing the camera.",
